---
description: Rules for the reusable rehearsal engine
globs: engine/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- engine/ has no HTTP, accounts or app imports; it must stay embeddable in other apps.
- Every Store method except insert and failStale takes the scope and filters by it.
- Agent logic (prompts, model calls, simulation, research, pricing) is Python in agents/flockcast_agents, never TypeScript; engine/agents.ts is the only bridge.
- New adapters (source, store, engine) implement the interfaces in engine/types.ts and get a test in test/engine.test.ts against test/fake-model.ts.
- Model output is untrusted: shape-check JSON before use; never execute or render it as HTML.
- Keep the offline estimate working and labelled when there is no model key.
